#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

<span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">**Die Linke**</span> has an unusually diverse and multifaceted web of ideological currents and caucuses. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @oldleft: [? if oldleft_leader == "Wagenknecht" or oldleft_leader == "Pellmann" : A conservative populist stance would help us regain dissatisfied and right-wing voters. ?][? if oldleft_leader == "Riexinger" or oldleft_leader == "Wissler" : We should adopt a left-wing populist stance and work together with trade unions and radical progressive groups to achieve our goals. ?]
- @beweli: We should adopt a radical, intersectional stance and combine economic and social issues.
- @emali: A centrist position remains the best to solve our internal disputes.
- @pragmatist: We should work towards concrete reforms through collaboration with the moderate left.
- @easy_discard

@oldleft
on-arrival: ideology = "radical populist"; oldleft_strength += 6; bsw_relation += 3; oldleft_dissent -= 5; pragmatist_dissent += 4; beweli_dissent += 3; foreign_moderation -= 0.5; spd_relation -= 3; greens_relation -= 3;

Our old left wing, led by [+ oldleft_leader +], is pleased by our decision.

@beweli
on-arrival: ideology = "radical progressive"; beweli_strength += 6; beweli_dissent -= 5; oldleft_dissent += 3; pragmatist_dissent += 3; social_moderation -= 0.5;

The Movement Left approves of our decision.

@emali
on-arrival: ideology = "centrist"; emali_strength += 6; emali_dissent -= 5; oldleft_dissent -= 1; beweli_dissent -= 2; pragmatist_dissent -= 3;

Our decision to endorse the centrists is met with no great complaint by other factions.

@pragmatist
on-departure: ideology = "pragmatic"; pragmatist_strength += 8; pragmatist_dissent -= 5; oldleft_dissent += 4; beweli_dissent += 4; spd_relation += 4; greens_relation += 4; cdu_relation += 3;

The pragmatist faction is pleased by our decision.
